    // Vignette: towel roll + water bottle — placed beside the mat to tie it together as a "workout corner". (A base deck was tried and removed:
    // flat pads in this world are shallow craters pressed down to ground 0, so a low slab always looks buried in the lip.
    // Placing directly on the pad floor like the swing · seesaw is this terrain's grammar.)
