// Rule: ribs, bumps and ridges are **not attached but modulated into the outline/height field** → only triangles grow, draw calls stay 1.
// Shells are always-on objects (beach 3 + desert islands 1~3), so draw calls and materials are the budget; triangles have plenty of slack.
// ⚠️ arc (fan spread) is **the #1 knob that separates species**. Kept narrow at 1.2~1.3 rad (≈70°) it becomes a tall
