//   ① The oyster's identity is **asymmetry** — different rough phase/depth per valve (bottom=deep cup, top=shallow lid)
//   ② Outer and inner faces use **different cells** (outer=chalky flakes, inner=smooth nacre+muscle scar) → faceAttr
