        // ⚠️ At alpha 0.10~0.22 they vanished into the chalk. Blotches must be **dark and sparse** (cartoon rule).
        // ⚠️ Adding radial stripes (hinge→free edge) crossed the horizontal flakes into a **tartan check** (measured).
        // An oyster shell reads as **blotches bleeding along the layer grain**, not radial patterns → unify to one axis.
        // ① 7 dark blotches — elongated along the layer direction (horizontal). Overlap several for a soft-edged bleed.
