// ==== /🦐 Shrimp =============================================================================

// ==== 🐙 Octopus — a sack + 8 extended, curling arms, not a sphere + macaroni rings ==========================
// Old modeling: head was a plain sphere, arms were **8 partial tori lying on the floor** (pink croissant rings), so
// they didn't attach to the head and the tips were cut off bluntly. Eyes had separate spheres for white and pupil, misaligning by angle.
// Discipline: the mantle is a sack loft, arms are **individual swept tubes** (radius 0 at the tip = pointed), suckers aren't
// attached but are disp bump rows, eyes are mantle disp bumps + texture pupils (no separate spheres, eliminating misalignment at the source).
